   "Id": "m0153:0x060033F9",
   "ProposedName": "ReadBusInterfaceFeaturesAsync",
   "Reason": "Reads device descriptor, serial number, APDU size, medium, communication modes, busmonitor time base, programming-mode support and RF/filtering capabilities. Initial feature-service descriptor failures are swallowed; later cEMI descriptor fallback may propagate errors. Missing medium uses descriptor/master-data fallback or TP1; explicit medium flags prefer PL over RF. RF physical-feature read failure uses ScanFx|TxFx|FastAck. Several property reads intentionally use CancellationToken.None. In the non-cEMI path, the BCU programming-mode test runs only when a descriptor fallback was needed.",
   "Source": [
